sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client
  participant APIGW as API Gateway <br> ban-xrs-apigw
  participant API as RewardPointsAccountAdmin-Product <br> ms-lc-rpa-reward_points_account_admin-product
  participant Param as Lib Regionalizacion <br> lib-java-webflux_core-xrs v. 2.4.3-SNAPSHOT
  participant Wrapper as Wrapper Abanks Multiconexion <br> HU 16254
  participant Errors as Lib Errores <br> lib-java-webflux_core-xrs v. 2.4.3-SNAPSHOT



  Client->>APIGW: DELETE /account-management/reward-points-account-admin/v1/{campaignReference}/remove-reward-points
  Note right of Client: Headers: Source-Bank, Authorization, Application-Id <br> Path Param: campaignReference

  rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
    Note over Client,APIGW: Autenticacion y Autorizacion
    APIGW->>APIGW: Validar Token Bearer
    alt Token invalido o ausente
      APIGW-->>Client: Error 401
    end
    alt Sin permisos suficientes
      APIGW-->>Client: Error 403
    end
    APIGW->>API: Forward Request
  end

  rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
    Note over API,Client: Validacion Campos Obligatorios
    API->>API: ValidacionEsquema OpenAPI
    API->>API: Validar Headers obligatorios <br> Source-Bank, Authorization, Application-Id
    API->>API: Validar Path Param obligatorio <br> campaignReference (minimo 1 caracter)
    alt Errores de validacion
      API-->>Client: Error 400
    end
  end

  rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
    Note over Client,Param: Proceso Validacion Regional
    API->>API: Cache Local <br> key: remove-reward-points
    alt Cache Config Not Found
      API->>Param: Solicitud Validacion
      Note over Param: Consulta config regional Dynamo <br> COUNTRY#XRS#DOMAIN#REWARD_POINTS_ACCOUNT_ADMIN#PARAM#remove-reward-points
      Param-->>API: Respuesta Validacion
      alt Param o servicio de config no disponible
        API-->>Client: Error 502 (PARAMETER_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE)
      end
      API->>API: Almacenar Config Dynamo (TTL 24h) Cache Local
    end
    alt Destination-Bank nulo o vacio
      Note over API: Destination-Bank = Source-Bank
    end
    API->>API: Construir clave region = Source-Bank + Destination-Bank
    API->>API: Validar region habilitada
    Note over API: Regiones disponibles: <br> HN01-HN01, GT01-GT01, PA01-PA01, NI01-NI01
    alt Region no encontrada o disabled
      API-->>Client: Error 422 (REGION_NOT_CONFIGURED / REGION_NOT_ENABLED)
    end
  end

  Note over API: Uso del Patron Strategy
  API->>API: Selecciona estrategia por Source-Bank

  Note over API: Strategy por Source-Bank — procesamiento identico para todas las regiones <br> solo cambia la conexion/esquema de BD por pais.

  alt Source-Bank = HN01, GT01, PA01, NI01
    rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
      Note over API,Wrapper: Configuracion conexion por pais (SI APLICA)
      API->>API: Resolver param_name / secret_name del config regional
      Note over API: param_name: ban-{iso3}-ic-comp-parm-wrapper-abanks-db-{env} <br> secret_name: ban-{iso3}-ic-comp-secm-wrapper-abanks-db-{env}
    end

    rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
      Note over API,Wrapper: Eliminar Factor de Canje (operacion de escritura)
      API->>API: Preparar Payload Eliminar Factor Canje
      Note over API: campaignReference -> PV_IDPROMOCION <br> upper-case(Application-User) -> PV_USUARIO
      API->>Wrapper: POST /wrapper-abanks/v1/execute-procedure <br> [operationType: update]
      Note over Wrapper: connectionType: jca <br> SP: PL_P_ELIMINAR_FACTOR_CANJE <br> Conexion por pais: ConnectionProxyAbanksHN / GT / PA / ConnectionProxyNI
      alt Fallo integracion Wrapper Abanks
        Wrapper-->>API: Error homologado del wrapper
        API-->>Client: Retorna error homologado
      else Integracion exitosa
        Wrapper-->>API: OutputParameters (PV_CODIGOMENSAJE, PV_DESCRIPCIONMENSAJE)
        API->>API: Evaluar Payload Eliminar Factor Canje
        alt PV_CODIGOMENSAJE != SUCCESS
          API-->>Client: Error 422
        else PV_CODIGOMENSAJE = SUCCESS
          API-->>Client: 200 OK
          Note right of Client: data: { transactionDateTime, reference, userApplication }
        end
      end
    end
  end

  activate API
    alt Exception occurs
      note over Errors: Error Library Handler
      activate Errors
        API ->> Errors: BusinessCoreException(apiMethod, applicationBackend, errorMessage, errorCode)
        Errors -->> API: httpCode, businessErrorCode, shortDesc, longDesc
      deactivate Errors
      activate Client
        API -->> Client: Retorna error
      deactivate Client
    end
  deactivate API
  Note over Client,Errors: Diagrama guia de manejo de errores <br> http://bit.ly/4rpKVIU